  "is_prerecorded": false,
  "description": "This week on Convergence Zone we dive into the remarkable new album “Littlefolk” by Mount Maxwell — it’s a journey beyond his Vancouver BC home with effortless moves between timbres and tonality, field recordings and folktronica, and beats and bloops\n\nWe will continue the journey with recent music from Mary Lattimore, Lusine, K Leimer, Pure Bathing Culture, Steven Wilson, Mike Reed, and some vintage Erik Wøllo and Harold Budd\n\nWe may also hear some Roxy Music without Brian Eno, and Brian Eno without Roxy Music",
